  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kNytodv.png\" alt=\"YUNG的叢林神廟優化\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"需依賴YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入YUNG GANG Discord群組!\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"追蹤我的Twitter!\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"訂閱我的YouTube頻道!\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在Patreon贊助我!\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ujP2J5g.png\" alt=\"這是什麼?\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p><strong>徹底重製Minecraft的叢林神廟！</strong> YUNG的叢林神廟優化從頭到尾重新設計了叢林神廟，包含全新結構、陷阱、謎題與戰利品！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ladFuIF.png\" alt=\"兼容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p>本模組內建與多款模組的兼容性！若您安裝以下模組，神廟特定區域將有機會生成特殊結構。此為選用功能，即使未安裝這些模組仍可正常使用叢林神廟優化。</p><ul>\n<li>Create</li>\n<li>Supplementaries</li>\n<li>Alex's Mobs</li>\n</ul><p>本模組亦完全兼容所有地形生成類模組，包括：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-ocean-monuments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的海底遺蹟優化</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-nether-fortresses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的地獄要塞優化</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的額外內容</a></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用優惠碼YUNGNICKYOUNG可享Bisect Hosting 25%折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
